
### 1. HOME API
GET http://localhost:3000/


### 2. GET ALL BOOKS
GET http://localhost:3000/books


### 3. GET BOOK BY ID
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1


### 4. SEARCH BOOKS
GET http://localhost:3000/books?search_q=Harry


### 5. SORT BOOKS ASCENDING
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order_by=price&order=ASC


### 6. SORT BOOKS DESCENDING
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order_by=price&order=DESC


### 7. PAGINATION
GET http://localhost:3000/books?limit=2&offset=0


### 8. PRICE RANGE FILTER
GET http://localhost:3000/books?min_price=300&max_price=500


### 9. COMBINE SEARCH, SORT AND PAGINATION
GET http://localhost:3000/books?search_q=The&order_by=price&order=ASC&limit=5&offset=0


### 10. CREATE NEW BOOK
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "JavaScript Basics",
    "author": "John Smith",
    "price": 350
}


### 11. CREATE BOOK WITH INVALID DATA
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "",
    "author": "",
    "price": "abc"
}


### 12. UPDATE BOOK
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Updated Harry Potter",
    "author": "J.K. Rowling",
    "price": 550
}


### 13. UPDATE NON-EXISTING BOOK
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/100
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Test Book",
    "author": "Test Author",
    "price": 200
}


### 14. DELETE BOOK
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/2


### 15. DELETE NON-EXISTING BOOK
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/100


### 16. INVALID BOOK ID
GET http://localhost:3000/books/100


### 17. INVALID SORT FIELD
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order_by=password


### 18. INVALID SORT ORDER
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order=RANDOM


### 19. INVALID PAGINATION
GET http://localhost:3000/books?limit=-5&offset=-1


### 20. INVALID PRICE FILTER
GET http://localhost:3000/books?min_price=abc


### 21. INVALID ROUTE
GET http://localhost:3000/students
